{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社10月23日報道，兩名伊朗高級安全官員透露，伊朗已經制定了針對波斯灣海底通信電纜的詳細打擊計劃。如果美國和以色列再次對伊朗發動軍事行動，德黑蘭可能將這些承載國際互聯網通信的關鍵基礎設施列為攻擊目標，並試圖阻止受損電纜得到及時維修，以延長通信中斷時間。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583620.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T19:24:21.645648+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":134,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T19:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:20.879055+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T19:18:20.879055+00:00","content_hash":"3e357e857bd82ff2c4f6fe05390702779f32835ef99b058f8de16b26d541679e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}